  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\n**Given Equation: **32 * 14 * 18 * 9 * 12 * 22\n\nLet's check each Option One by One:\n\nOption 1) −, +, ÷, ×, =\n\nGiven: 32 * 14 * 18 * 9 * 12 * 22\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n32 - 14 + __**18 ÷ 9**__ × 12 = 22\n\n32 - 14 + __**2 × 12**__ = 22\n\n__**32**__ - 14 __**+ 24**__ = 22\n\n__**56 - 14**__ = 22\n\n42 ≠ 22.\n\n**Option 2) +, −, ÷, ×, =**\n\nGiven: 32 * 14 * 18 * 9 * 12 * 22\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n32 + 14 - __**18 ÷ 9**__ × 12 = 22\n\n32 + 14 - __**2 × 12 **__= 22\n\n__**32 + 14**__ - 24 = 22\n\n__**46 - 24**__ = 22\n\n**22 = 22.**\n\nOption 3) ×, +, ÷, −, =\n\nGiven: 32 * 14 * 18 * 9 * 12 * 22\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n32 × 14 + __**18 ÷ 9**__ - 12 = 22\n\n__**32 × 14**__ + 2 - 12 = 22\n\n__**448 + 2**__ - 12 = 22\n\n__**450 - 12**__ = 22\n\n438 ≠ 22.\n\nOption 4) ÷, −, +, ×, =\n\nGiven: 32 * 14 * 18 * 9 * 12 * 22\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n__**32 ÷ 14 **__- 18 + 9 × 12 = 22\n\n2.28 - 18 + __**9 × 12**__ = 22\n\n__**2.28**__ - 18 __**+ 108**__ = 22\n\n__**110.28 - 18**__ = 22\n\n92.28 ≠ 22.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 2'.***",
